@startuml UC05 - Enroll Follow-up - Sequence Diagram
title UC05 - Enroll Follow-up - Sequence Diagram

actor "Sales User" as Sales
participant "Next.js" as FE
participant "NestJS API" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "RabbitMQ" as MQ

Sales -> FE : 1. Open Lead Detail
FE -> API : 2. Get Lead
API -> DB : 3. Query Lead
DB --> API : 4. Return Lead
FE -> Sales : 5. Display Lead Score
Sales -> FE : 6. Select Follow-up Sequence
FE -> API : 7. POST enrollment
API -> DB : 8. Validate Sequence
DB --> API : 9. Return Sequence
API -> DB : 10. Create Enrollment
API -> MQ : 11. Publish followup.started
API --> FE : 12. Return ACTIVE Enrollment

@enduml
